### 2025-09-13 16:05:42.260
-- Test the problematic expression: 8/2*3 < (1+col2)*col3*2
### 2025-09-13 16:05:42.261
-- Left side: 8/2*3 = 4*3 = 12
### 2025-09-13 16:05:42.261
-- For row 1: Right side = (1+1)*2.72*2 = 2*2.72*2 = 10.88, so 12 < 10.88 = false (should NOT select)
### 2025-09-13 16:05:42.262
-- For row 3: Right side = (1+3)*3.7*2 = 4*3.7*2 = 29.6, so 12 < 29.6 = true (should select)
### 2025-09-13 16:05:42.262
